{"b":4,"c":8,"v":[[1,[["All the commandments which I command thee this day shall ye observe to do, that ye may live, and multiply, and go in and possess the land which the LORD sware unto your fathers.","de 4:1;de 5:32,33;de 6:1-3;ps 119:4-6;1th 4:1,2"]]],[2,[["remember","de 7:18;ps 77:11;ps 106:7;eph 2:11,12;2pe 1:12,13;2pe 3:1,2"],["led thee","de 1:3,33;de 2:7;de 29:5;ps 136:16;am 2:10"],["to humble","2ch 32:25,26;2ch 33:12,19;job 33:17;job 42:5,6;isa 2:17;lu 18:14;jas 4:6,10;1pe 5:5,6"],["prove thee","de 8:16;de 13:3;ge 22:1;ex 15:25;ex 16:4;2ch 32:31;ps 81:7;pr 17:3;mal 3:2,3;jas 1:3;1pe 1:7"],["to know","jer 17:9,10;joh 2:25;re 2:23"]]],[3,[["fed thee","ex 16:2,3,12-35;ps 78:23-25;ps 105:40;1co 10:3"],["doth","ps 37:3;ps 104:27-29;mt 4:4;lu 4:4;lu 12:29,30;heb 13:5,6"]]],[4,[["Thy raiment waxed not old upon thee, neither did thy foot swell, these forty years.","de 29:5;ne 9:21;mt 26:25-30"]]],[5,[["consider","de 4:9,23;isa 1:3;eze 12:3;eze 18:28"],["as a man","2sa 7:14;job 5:17,18;ps 89:32;ps 94:12;pr 3:12;1co 11:32;heb 12:5-11;re 3:19"]]],[6,[["walk","de 5:33;ex 18:20;1sa 12:24;2ch 6:31;ps 128:1;lu 1:6"]]],[7,[["For the LORD thy God bringeth thee into a good land, a land of brooks of water, of fountains and depths that spring out of valleys and hills;","de 6:10,11;de 11:10-12;ex 3:8;ne 9:24,25;ps 65:9-13;eze 20:6"]]],[8,[["wheat","de 32:14;2sa 4:6;1ki 5:11;ps 81:16;ps 147:14;eze 27:17"],["barley","2ch 2:10-15;joh 6:9,13"],["vines","isa 7:23;jer 5:17;ho 2:8,22;mic 4:4;hab 3:17"]]],[9,[["whose stones","de 33:25;jos 22:8;1ch 22:14;job 28:2"]]],[10,[["thou hast","de 6:11,12;ps 103:2;mt 14:19;joh 6:23;ro 14:6;1co 10:31;1th 5:18;1ti 4:4,5"],["then thou","1ch 29:14;ps 103:2;pr 3:9"]]],[11,[["Beware that thou forget not the LORD thy God, in not keeping his commandments, and his judgments, and his statutes, which I command thee this day:","ps 106:21;pr 1:32;pr 30:9;eze 16:10-15;ho 2:8,9"]]],[12,[["Lest when","de 28:47;de 31:20;de 32:15;pr 30:9;ho 13:5,6"],["and hast bu